// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_pua_netscan.yml
// ID Sigma: ca387a8e-1c84-4da3-9993-028b45342d30
// Título: PUA - SoftPerfect Netscan Execution
// Descripción: Detects usage of SoftPerfect's "netscan.exe". An application for scanning networks.
It is actively used in-the-wild by threat actors to inspect and understand the network architecture of a victim.

// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_pua_netscan.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\netscan.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoProductName =~ "Network Scanner" or ProcessVersionInfoFileDescription =~ "Application for scanning networks"
